Do ivLstMessages.$clear()

For pRefLstRecords.$line from 1 to pRefLstRecords.$linecount step 1
	Set reference lvRefRow to pRefLstRecords.C1.$ref
	Do ivLstMessages.$add()
	Calculate ivLstMessages.$line as ivLstMessages.$linecount
	
	Calculate ivLstMessages.Partition as lvRefRow.partition
	Calculate ivLstMessages.Offset as lvRefRow.offset
	Calculate ivLstMessages.Key as utf8tochar(binfrombase64(lvRefRow.key))
	Calculate ivLstMessages.Message as lvRefRow.value
	Calculate ivLstMessages.Topic as lvRefRow.topic
End For

Calculate ivLstMessages.$line as pick(ivLstMessages.$linecount>0,0,1)

Redraw (Refresh now) cgMessages
Quit method